    "title": "Madras Police Department take man into custody after vehicle and on foot pursuit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Candice Stilwell ,\n1 days ago A man was arrested April 26 after allegedly fleeing police and crashing into a car in Madras. According to the Madras Police Department, officers responded about 2 p.m. to reports of a male driver trying to “run down” another vehicle and driving erratically. Additional reports of a potential domestic violence situation involving the driver and his female passenger were also given to law enforcement. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
